&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Outbound into Enterprise Accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Qualify inbound leads to generate quality meetings with all levels of employees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build account plans with your Account Executive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Organise, log activity, and categorise sales lead information into our CRM, as well as utilise other prospecting tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
