&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Adhere to your inbound and outbound KPIs as well as being comfortable balancing your time &amp;amp; competing priorities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
