&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4 to 7 years of experience in marketing analytics, GTM/marketing strategy, revenue operations analytics, FP&amp;amp;A or business intelligence within a B2B SaaS environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong planning and financial-modeling skills: comfortable building target, budget, and pipeline-coverage models from ambiguous inputs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to independently structure ambiguous problems, move quickly, and drive them to clear, actionable recommendations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Clear point of view and the confidence to challenge assumptions and bring data-backed perspectives to senior stakeholders, including a VP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfort operating in a fast-changing environment where definitions, targets, and operating models are still evolving, and the ability to balance speed with rigor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding of B2B SaaS performance metrics: pipeline, ACV, conversion rates, velocity, marketing-sourced vs. influenced pipeline, and attribution concepts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfortable with SQL, Excel/google sheets and BI/visualization tools like Looker to move quickly through data&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of Salesforce (reports, dashboards, opportunity data), marketing automation platforms (Marketo preferred), and ad platforms (Demandbase, Google Ads, LinkedIn Ads, chatgpt Ads, etc)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
