&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investment ROI:&lt;/strong&gt; Evaluate the return on sales investments by analyzing incremental headcount, productivity, pipeline generation, bookings, ARR, contribution margin, and payback&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting and Annual Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Support quarterly forecasts, long-range planning, annual operating plans, target setting, and scenario analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare monthly and quarterly forecast-to-actuals reporting, variance analysis, and performance narratives for Sales and Finance leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
