&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Remove blockers rather than just report status, escalate early when something is stuck, and be able to show what measurably changed as a result of these cadences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
