&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Actively expands professional networks through proactive outreach and initiated partner events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Leads initiatives to foster collaboration and knowledge-sharing among partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
