&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You can work independently without operating in a silo. You know when to make the call, when to ask for another perspective, and when something needs to be escalated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You notice patterns. You&#39;re interested not only in solving today&#39;s issue but in understanding why it&#39;s happening and whether we&#39;re seeing it elsewhere.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
