&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work closely with Functional HRBPs.&lt;/strong&gt; They&#39;ll bring the broader functional and leadership context; you&#39;ll bring what you&#39;re seeing with managers, employees, and teams across the region. You&#39;ll work together without duplicating each other&#39;s roles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help us build.&lt;/strong&gt; This is a new model and not everything will be perfectly defined on day one. You&#39;ll help us figure out what works, challenge what doesn&#39;t, and build approaches we can scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
