&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are building data pipelines to power the modern data stack for thousands of companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;span style=&quot;color: #333333;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Manager &lt;/strong&gt;to serve as the operational backbone of our pricing and monetization strategy in addition to supporting strategic initiatives, as needed. Sitting within Product Program Management and partnering closely with Analytics, Product, Sales, Product Marketing, RevOps, Finance, and Engineering, you&#39;ll own the cross-functional execution that turns pricing strategy into well-governed, shipped programs. You&#39;ll coordinate launches end to end, track commitments, resolve escalations, and expand the playbook that makes growth at Fivetran repeatable and scalable. This is a high-visibility role for someone who thrives at the intersection of program management, GTM, and product strategy.&amp;nbsp; You will be driving some of the most impactful business outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, hybrid position based out of our Oakland, CA office. Our hybrid work model offers a blend of remote flexibility and in-person collaboration, including two days in the office each week to connect and build as a team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies You’ll Use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Google Workspace(sheets)/Excel, Jira, Looker/Sigma/Hex, Notion, Salesforce and Slack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Drive program governance, including running various meetings and decision-making cadences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Lead Growth &amp;amp; Monetization planning in close partnership with Sales &amp;amp; Engineering leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Track program deliverables and commitments end to end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Coordinate engineering timelines, dependencies, and launch readiness with the ePMO.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Partner with Product Marketing and RevOps on enablement plans and rollout execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Manage sales escalations and the cross-functional coordination required to resolve them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Partner with Finance and Analytics on analyses and ad hoc business metric requests from stakeholders across the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Report on outcomes, such as closed-lost-due-to-pricing and overall pricing impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Expand upon and further operationalize Fivetran&#39;s pricing and program management playbooks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Proven experience in program management or product operations, ideally supporting pricing, monetization, or GTM initiative in B2B SaaS and with consumption based pricing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• A track record of driving cross-functional execution across Product, Sales, Marketing, and Engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Excellent stakeholder management and executive communication, including tracking and reporting on commitments to senior leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Strong analytical skills, with the ability to interpret pricing and revenue data and translate it into clear insights and recommendations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Experience establishing operating rhythms, governance processes, and repeatable playbooks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Familiarity with GTM and RevOps tooling and processes (e.g., Salesforce, CPQ, and BI tools such as Looker).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;• Highly organized and self-directed, able to manage multiple concurrent programs in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Skills​&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;-Experience in data processing (ETL, ELT) and/or cloud-based platforms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;-PMP Certified&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range displayed on this job posting reflects the minimum and maximum target for new hire compensation for the target position and level, and may include sales incentives or target bonuses depending on the role. &amp;nbsp;Our compensation ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Our job titles may span more than one career level. Within the range, individual compensation is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, relevant education or training, business need, market demands. The compensation range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. Your recruiter can share more about the specific compensation range for your location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Oakland Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$139,729&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$167,681.50 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
