&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Fivetran + dbt Labs is building data pipelines to power the modern data stack for thousands of companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for an Enterprise Account Executive to join our growing EMEA team, specifically working with customers and prospects in the Nordics. In this role, you’ll partner with leading enterprise businesses to understand their needs, deliver solutions, and build long-term relationships that drive mutual success. You’ll manage a full sales cycle, develop new opportunities, and collaborate across teams to achieve results. Fivetran has already developed a strong customer base in the region and now is the time to accelerate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;If you’re motivated by creating value for customers, enjoy working in a collaborative environment, and want to make an impact at a fast-growing company, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time, remote role based in the UK or Ireland, with a strong preference for candidates located in the London or Dublin area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
