&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Senior Data Management Partner is a senior individual contributor on the Data Management team.This role independently leads both complex projects, and time-sensitive employee data work and uses sound judgment to make decisions within established policies, controls, and compliance requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;In partnership with the Data Management manager, this person will help build the infrastructure for how the team operates, including its processes, controls, documentation, metrics, and quality standards. The role works closely with HRIS, Payroll, Benefits, and People Operations to strengthen data integrity, improve operational efficiency, and support a reliable employee experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Employee Lifecycle Transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Execute and oversee complex or time-sensitive Workday transactions, including hires, job changes, and terminations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(67, 67, 67) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(67, 67, 67); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support Workday EIB processing and bulk data updates, validating inputs and results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain employee records and upload or manage supporting documentation in accordance with data privacy and retention requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support benefits and payroll data entry, updates, reconciliations, and issue resolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
