&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Data Quality, Audits, and Compliance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Design, implement, document, and train the Data Management team on SOX readiness audits for hires and terminations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Establish and maintain audit practices, data quality controls, and scorecards that promote accurate and complete employee records.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Monitor pending and aged transactions, identify root causes, and coordinate follow-up to keep work moving within established timelines.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Coordinate with internal partners and support internal or external audits by providing accurate records, evidence, and process documentation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Team Infrastructure and Process Improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
