&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Consult with the team on procedures, job aids, and process documentation that support consistent execution and team onboarding.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
