&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Lead payroll process optimization and Data Management process cleanup.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with Data Management Manager to develop team reporting, operational metrics, and review practices to improve visibility into workload, service delivery, and data quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with the Data Management Manager to prepare processes to be automation ready and identify and prioritize automation opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
