&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong ability to analyze and present data accurately, and use it to tell a story&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
