&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0) !important; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Integrate recognition into everyday tools and processes (e.g., Slack, Workday) and align it with company values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
